<title>USA: Malaysia Airlines to order Boeing jets.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Airlines to order Boeing jets.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia Airlines Thursday announced plans to order up to 15 ultra long-range Boeing 777-200X aircraft.</p>
<p>In a statement, Boeing and Malaysia Airlines said they signed a memorandum of understanding at a ceremony March 4 unveiling the first of fifteen 777s ordered by the airline last year.</p>
<p>Boeing did not disclose the value of the order.</p>
</text>
